 if kevin hart  was jealous that he was playing black  adam here was his response  [Applause]  your name  nathan mason but well hold on one second  i'm going to get your question a second  but mason buddy that was a great  question thank you uh the truth is  yes kevin hart gets jealous of  everything  but also i want and i can i'm pretty  good with height you're already taller  than kevin hart  now about dc it kind of seems like they  are trying to do some sort of a soft  reboot warner brothers has obviously  been having a hard time recently with  ezra miller and amber heard and  everything they've been going through it  hasn't exactly been easy on the studio  and even before that fans were really  complaining about the dceu but during  the panel the rock actually teased us a  little bit he said that the goal of  black adam is to usher in a new era in  the dc universe now we're not really  sure what's going to happen in the flash  movie but alternate timelines could be  created and a new dc universe could be  reborn and let's keep our fingers  crossed that that is going to happen  because we need better continuity in the  dc universe and speaking of which they  did actually reveal that amanda waller  is going to be in black adam now what's  interesting about that and is very  obvious about the trailers and the  footage that we have seen for black adam  already is that black adam is not going  to listen to really anybody he's going  to do whatever the heck that he wants to  do so if she's gonna try to control him  that is not going to go very well now  she might be sending the task force  after him perhaps she could even be  behind the jsa but it is interesting  that she is indeed going to be in this  film now in this new footage we get more  about the plot of black adam where he is  trying to decide kind of who he is going  to be and the justice society of america  specifically dr fate who is played by  pierce brosnan in this movie is trying  to get him to use his powers for good to  be a hero and not a villain now the  justice society of america is a good  superhero team and they actually focus  on nurturing superhero legacies and they  even train young and new superheroes and  we actually see some of that in this  trailer and we can tell that the justice  society of america doesn't actually want  to fight black adam but they would like  him to become a super hero someone who  uses their powers for good but of course  like i mentioned black adam doesn't want  to listen to anybody so there's going to  kind of be two fights in the black adam  film black adam going up against the  justice society of america because  they're trying to stop him from being  out of control and destroying everything  this is demonstrated very well in the  first trailer that we got for black adam  where hawkman says heroes don't kill  people and black adam says well i do  claiming that he is not a hero he was  once a slave in ancient egypt his son  was killed and now he has the powers of  a god and kneels before nobody he is not  listening to anyone however the jsa is  trying to help black adam and they are  not the villains of the film the villain  is reportedly going to be sabach who is  essentially the opposite of shazam when  he calls out sabach he gets the powers  of satan em belil bezel bub asmodeus and  kratos and i wouldn't be surprised if  the jsa stepped in and helped black adam  defeat savic but not until we get some  pretty great fight scenes between black  adam and the justice society of america  they actually give us a really really  great scene of hawkman going up against  black adam black adam stopping him with  no problem and then basically shooting  lightning at him so expect a lot of  action coming up in black adam now  during dc's hall h we did get our first  look at shazam fury of the gods and this  is also very interesting because in the  beginning of the trailer it shows the  old justice league they show footage  from the justice league of the flash  aquaman and batman ben affleck's batman  of course confirming that this still  exists in that same universe which is  very interesting because we should  assume that black adam exists in the  shazam universe since they're so heavily  connected plus not to mention the  deleted shazam scene where they all sit  on their thrones but there was one empty  chair that was meant to be for black  adam so they should be in the same  universe which means black adam is in  the same universe as superman as batman  as the flash etc so there is hope for a  black adam versus shazam fight and a  black adam versus superman and shazam  still but in this trailer they show us  that billy batson is actually having a  hard time being a superhero because of  course he's still a teenager despite  looking like a grown-up when he says  shazam and turns into shazam he still  always has the mind of a teenager the  trailer actually opens up with billy  batson expressing his sort of  disappointment in himself to what  appeared to be a therapist but is  revealed to be a pediatrician and during  this time it shows him kind of failing  at being a superhero and having a very  hard time he talks about how cool the  other superheroes are the flash batman  aquaman and how he's not doing a good  job and his family isn't exactly  clicking and zachary levi actually  revealed during the panel he said it's  been a few years since the shazamali  gained their powers and it looks like  there will be some interpersonal family  drama which you kind of see in this  trailer where shazam says everybody's  kind of doing their own thing now and  i'm the only one trying to keep it  together so there will be a little bit  of struggle between the shazamali but  i'm sure they'll come together at the  end of course to defeat the villains who  are revealed in this trailer to be the  daughters of atlas played by lucy leo  and helen mirren helen marin plays  hespera and lucy liu plays calypso and  in this trailer we hear hespera say  children have stolen the power of all  the gods now what's really important to  know here is that obviously since these  are the daughters of atlas atlas was  their father in which the wizard shazam  was the one who actually killed him so  now in this film they are seeking  revenge on anyone with shazam powers now  we see them go to a museum and they find  the shazam staff that was actually used  to kill their father and based off of  what we know about the film they have  found an artifact that can power the  staff so they use this staff as their  main weapon to seek revenge on the  shazam family we see them do some pretty  incredible things with it lucy leo's  calypso even summons a huge dragon now  it's also important to note that they do  actually have another sister and this is  rachel zegler's character but she  actually ends up bonding with freddy  freeman when she comes to earth and her  sisters kind of turn against her so  she's probably going to actually be a  good guy in this movie but the shazam  family and the justice society of  america have their hands full with these  two trailers and hopefully this is a  good sign that dc is heading in a good  direction hopefully all will be revealed  soon in the meantime let me know what  you thought about these two trailers and  the dc panel and of course i'll be  covering marvel's hall h coming up in a  few hours here so don't forget to  subscribe and follow me on instagram and  twitter for live updates as always thank  you all so much for watching woof

